  "tekst": "Vita Kamliuk is a licensed California real estate agent based in Los Angeles. She is currently affiliated with Compass, and Compass lists her as REALTOR® DRE #02166055. Her official Compass profile lists specialties including buyer representation, listings, relocation, and property management, and says she works in both English and Russian. ([compass.com](https://www.compass.com/agents/vita-kamliuk/?utm_source=openai))\n\nHer own website says she primarily serves Greater Los Angeles, with a particular focus on the San Fernando Valley—such as Sherman Oaks, Valley Village, Studio City and Tarzana—and the Westside/Beverly Hills/West Hollywood area. ([askvita.com](https://askvita.com/?utm_source=openai))\n\nShe appears to have a substantial real-estate background predating her California residential work. Her biography says she previously worked in commercial real estate with Knight Frank and Colliers International and has handled hundreds of transactions. Those career claims come primarily from her own professional biography, so I would distinguish them from independently verified credentials. ([askvita.com](https://askvita.com/?utm_source=openai))\n\nOne potentially confusing point: older material identifies her with Keller Williams Beverly Hills. A 2022 VoyageLA profile, for example, described her as working at Keller Williams. ([voyagela.com](https://voyagela.com/interview/exploring-life-business-with-vita-kamliuk-of-keller-williams/?utm_source=openai)) That information is outdated. Current sources—including Compass's own agent directory and her recent professional activity in 2026—identify her with Compass. ([compass.com](https://www.compass.com/agents/vita-kamliuk/?utm_source=openai))\n\nSo, as of September 2026: Vita Kamliuk is with Compass.\n\nIf you're considering hiring her, I can also look into her recent sales/listings, transaction history, reviews, and California license status to give you a more independent picture of her track record.",
